[{"key":"api","title":"Build REST API","role":"backend","deps":[]},
 {"key":"ui","title":"Build login UI","role":"frontend","deps":["api"]}]
EOF
atm graph
atm map
```

Mid-run (same loop — not a second planner product):

```
